Error [jet.MissingMoveMarker]: `holder` cannot be moved from borrowed storage
  --> tests/ui/ownership/take_from_borrowed_parameter_field_is_rejected.jet:11:10
    |
 11 |     grab(holder.res.move())
    |          ^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: Read and write parameters and named windows keep ownership with their source
 Fix: Copy the value with `holder.copy()`, or declare the parameter `holder: &&Holder` to take ownership
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0201
